ally and in writing; knowledge of grounds, tree, and shrub care. Sponsorship eligibility: Candidates must be legally authorized to work in the U.S. on an ongoing basis without sponsorship. How to Apply Please submit the following documents: Application Application Window Applications close on: October 18, 2026 Anticipated Hiring Pay Range Hourly $ 15.00 - $17.78 Sign up for job alerts First Name (required) 4d8865bb Last Name (required) 24a92e13 Email (required) 01be3bc9 Select one or more from the lists below to receive information about specific jobs: 11648cc7 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Custodial / Landscaping / Maintenance Custodial / Landscaping / Maintenance Employment Type Staff Full Time (USS) Staff Full Time (USS) Locations Manhattan, Kansas, United States Manhattan, Kansas, United States Worksite On-site On-site Sign Up! Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you Save this job for later Add this job to your favorites or send it to yourself to apply later Save this job to your favorites or send it to yourself to apply later (required) f798a86e Last Name (required) e29148e6 Save this job to your favorites or send it to yourself to apply later d8621b78 Save Now! Please wait... Done Not You? We sent this job to you Share this job with a friend First Name (required) a5df4ead Last Name (required) 530c2e43 Email (required) 878cae6e Provide your friend's name and email and we'll send this job a1c07abf Share Now! Please wait... Done Not You? Thanks for sharing this job! You may also be interested in Accounting Specialist (Accounts Receivable & Cashiering) Manhattan Vet Med Support Services Director II, Enterprise Cloud Applications Manhattan Division of Info Tech HR Manager Manhattan Provost Office Video Player is loading. Play Video Play Skip Backward Skip 